B.Mv=s(["BREAKING NEWS: {name} just scored {score} against crabs. SB19 is shookt.","The Zone cleared, crowd hyped! {name} got {score} and saved the whole tour!","THE ZONE GUARDIAN HAS RISEN. {name} scored {score} and crabs are extinct.","{name} just performed the real GENTO. {score} points ng pure destruction.","SB19 Management is now hiring {name} as official crab bouncer. {score} points!","Dun kayooo! you, every second. {name} scored {score} in full anti-crab glory.","SB19 canceled crab invasion forever because {name} cleared The Zone with {score}.","{name} just WMIAN'd the universe. Score: {score}. Crabs are filing complaints.","Achievement unlocked: Certified Anti-Crab Legend. {name} scored {score}!"],t.s)
