B.a1L=new A.hy("BAZINGA","bazinga","One clean sweep and everything on screen goes with it. Say it like you mean it.","Common")
B.a1O=new A.hy("MANA","mana","A blessing straight to your countdown. Take the gift, keep both feet on the ground and never forget.","Uncommon")
B.a1P=new A.hy("TIMER PAUSE","timerpause","Buys you a moment that shouldn't exist. The clock stops, but only for you.","Uncommon")
B.a1S=new A.hy("GENTO","gento","Everything it touches turns to gold. Doesn't last forever, so move fast.","Uncommon")
B.a1T=new A.hy("8TONBALL","8tonball","Let something heavier do the work for a while. It doesn't ask twice, and it doesn't miss.","Rare")
B.a1J=new A.hy("WYAT","wyat","Keeps asking the same question. Answer right and it pays out, answer wrong and it costs you.","Rare")
B.a1Q=new A.hy("WHAT","what","Confusion has a color scheme, and it's already been memorized. You'll figure it out. Maybe.","Rare")
B.a1M=new A.hy("SFTS","sfts","Reach for the stars. Just make sure you're shooting at the right one.","Rare")
B.a1N=new A.hy("CRIMZONE","crimzone","Not everything in the red zone is worth the same. Distance has a price.","Rare")
B.a1R=new A.hy("WMIAN","wmian","Don't forrow your eyebrows. They're all coming to you now, big and small alike.","Legendary")
